# Vendor-installed skills. These are written here by their own tooling on every
# install, so tracking them means committing someone else's artifact and taking
# churn whenever the vendor updates it.
#
# context7-mcp is installed by `ctx7 setup --claude`, which
# scripts/install-agent-mcps runs. Each machine gets the current version.
context7-mcp/

# Databricks AI tools skills, symlinked in from ~/.databricks/aitools/skills by
# the Databricks CLI, so machine-local (work laptop only). The entries without a
# trailing slash arrive as symlinks, and git matches a symlink as a file, so a
# "dir/" pattern misses them and leaves them untracked.
databricks*
*mlflow*/
agent-evaluation/
spark-python-data-source
